cy  and cook will then play their respective  characters meanwhile it appears that the  older characters like damon targaryen  and king viserys the first will be  played by the same actors throughout the  season  while many of the major characters  showcased in this latest house of the  dragon trailer should already appear  familiar to those who have kept track of  the promotional materials released thus  far one notable character finally  appears in the flesh for the first time  a few quick shots show a blonde man in  combat sporting an eye patch these  physical characteristics clearly  identify him as aemond targaryen fans of  george r r martin's extended a song of  ice and fire universe know that eamond  is the child of king viserys targaryen  the first and alice and hightower  notably eamon is viserys's second oldest  male son but viserys chooses to make  neither amon nor his older brother aegon  targaryen his successor instead choosing  their elder half-sister rhaenyra this  choice divides members of the royal  court into camps i am to inherit the  iron throne  she will block my way also in the books  eamon's eye patch comes from a wound he  got in a fight against rhaenyra's son  lucerus it's physical evidence of  continuing tensions between king  viserys's sons and rhaenyra's immediate  family presumably then ayment will be a  thorn in rhaenyra's side in house of the  dragon  much like the iron throne another  lore-drenched object featured in game of  thrones makes an appearance astute fans  may have noticed the cat's paw dagger  pop up in the house of the dragon  trailer entertainment weekly confirmed  that it is in fact the very same blade  arya uses to slay the night king on game  of thrones before arya receives the  blade it goes through many hands and is  instrumental in setting up some major  events in the original show for one  littlefinger gives this valerian steel  dagger to an assassin who attempts to  kill bran stark that plan obviously does  not go